  "description": "Built from the ground up for the little guys and girls, the Aerox 16\" uses a full 6061-T6 alloy frame and crank to keep the weight down and allow the younger riders to shred on a bike without limits. With short and responsive frame geometry and even scaled down shorter 127mm 3pc forged alloy cranks and the 40mm topload stem, this sized-down machine is unlike anything else on the market. From first time novices to pint size aspiring PRO's, the Aerox is the perfect machine for those looking to start their journey in BMX.",
